cklog worth 44% of annual revenue.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (1.4x, 15.5% of sales), a maintenance pace."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.8%), and institutions hold 91%.","Insider trading is two-way: 3 purchases and 14 sales over the past year, net $24.7M sold.","It returns 3.0% a year to shareholders (2.3% in buybacks and 0.7% in dividends).","The share count has shrunk 6.5% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake."],"people":["With about 6,390 employees, each generates about $2.8M of revenue, 2.7x the Utilities median, and revenue has grown 7.0% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $206K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $4.6M (2x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (2/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $18K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":26,"head":"Avoid: its composite score (21) is below 25.","pros":["Revenue grew 9.2%/yr over 5y","EV/EBITDA 8.6x vs sector 12.6x","21 analysts' mean target $202 (+52%)"],"cons":["Composite 21, below the 25 line (gates 7/25)","Trades 15% above fair value of $116","ROIC 7.7% vs WACC 8.7%","Net debt/EBITDA 4.3x","Interest coverage only 1.6x"],"flags":["Its composite score (21) is below 25"],"need":[],"buy_below":98.4,"vc":{"base":115.76,"base_src":"dcf","bear":63.37,"bull":191.82,"alt_median":17.92,"n_alt":2,"gap":5.4581,"dispersion":0.1048,"level":"LOW","why":["Monte Carlo spread is wide","DCF is 546% above the other models' median ($17.92)","bull case is 3.0x the bear case"]},"med":{"pe":20.2834,"ev_ebitda":12.5675,"pfcf":19.9631,"pb":1.8172,"roic":0.0568,"gross_margin":0.3591,"fcf_margin":-0.0633,"div_yield":0.0325}},"mc_quantiles":[33.64,51.43,63.37,74.3,79.67,87.47,93.56,98.75,104.84,110.7,116.16,123.71,130.36,138.61,144.59,153.8,165.15,175.43,191.82,226.03,275.72],"mc_drivers":{"growth":0.744,"discount_rate":0.152,"terminal_growth":0.01,"exit_multiple":0.093},"ticker":"VST","date":"2026-11-13"}